Jupyter Lab is starting in an Apptainer container on a compute node. Sessions
usually start within a minute, but a busy queue can delay one for several
minutes before this card turns green.

Your notebooks run on the **Course Python** kernel, which teaching staff
maintain outside the image. Files under `/scratch` are fast working space and
are purged on a schedule; keep anything you need in your home directory.

Claude Code and Codex are preinstalled. Sign in with your own account in a
terminal — no shared credentials are built into the image.
